Spec: Route selection

Purpose:
  Search and summary for the followed-routes filter.

Owns:
  ./route_selection.dart
  /test/domain/route_selection_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/20-followed-rides.md

Must:
  Search matches the route display title, trimmed and case-insensitive; an empty query keeps every route.
  The summary lists the titles of the chosen routes in list order and drops ids without a route.
